01:59.767 --> 02:04.477
Episode 1:     Genius and X Are Two Sides Of the Same Coin

02:08.787 --> 02:12.777
<b><i>There are people in this world
who are labeled "geniuses."</i></b>

02:13.987 --> 02:16.047
<b>Finished, ma'am.</b>

02:16.787 --> 02:21.207
<b>I-It's correct, but what about
showing your work, Ogata?</b>

02:21.847 --> 02:23.307
<b>My work...</b>

02:24.127 --> 02:25.407
<b>Sorry. The moment I saw it,</b>

02:25.407 --> 02:28.717
<b>I knew what the answer was, 
so I skipped the work.</b>

02:30.177 --> 02:34.177
<b><i>When it comes to math 
and physics, she has no equal.</i></b>

02:34.177 --> 02:37.107
<b><i>She's an astonishing 143 centimeters tall.</i></b>

02:37.107 --> 02:39.097
<b><i>This is the "Thumbelina Supercomputer."</i></b>

02:40.037 --> 02:41.397
<b><i>Ogata Rizu.</i></b>

02:42.157 --> 02:48.397
<b>Furuhashi! What a...
What a touching, inspiring essay!</b>

02:49.227 --> 02:52.837
<b>Um, it's just a normal essay.</b>

02:52.837 --> 02:54.357
<b><i>I'll say it again.</i></b>

02:54.357 --> 02:57.367
<b><i>There are people in this world
who are labeled "geniuses."</i></b>

02:57.367 --> 03:01.367
<b>Even though Furuhashi was napping
until ten minutes before we had to turn it in...</b>

03:01.817 --> 03:04.087
<b>Geniuses really aren't like us!</b>

03:04.087 --> 03:06.627
<b>On top of that, she's beautiful!
I wish I was like her!</b>

03:08.227 --> 03:12.087
<b><i>Modern Japanese,
ancient writing, Chinese classics...</i></b>

03:12.587 --> 03:14.547
<b><i>She's raced to the top of all three subjects.</i></b>

03:15.487 --> 03:16.897
<b><i>That's Furuhashi Fumino.</i></b>

03:19.667 --> 03:23.147
<b><i>Of course there are people
who aren't geniuses.</i></b>

03:23.707 --> 03:26.877
<b><i>A student slow to understand
ever since he was a kid,</i></b>

03:26.877 --> 03:30.067
<b><i>who has to put more effort 
than others to learn something.</i></b>

03:30.067 --> 03:31.497
<b><i>An "ordinary talented student."</i></b>

03:32.237 --> 03:33.577
<b><i>That's me.</i></b>

03:44.587 --> 03:45.437
<b>Nari!</b>

03:46.037 --> 03:48.767
<b>Are you gonna study
at the school library again?</b>

03:48.767 --> 03:49.557
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:49.557 --> 03:51.757
<b>You should hang out with us once in a while.</b>

03:52.167 --> 03:53.417
<b>You're wasting your time.</b>

03:53.417 --> 03:56.447
<b>Nari has his eye on the 
special VIP recommendation.</b>

03:56.447 --> 04:00.307
<b>That? They say only an especially
excellent student is chosen.</b>

04:00.307 --> 04:01.387
<b>That's right.</b>

04:01.387 --> 04:03.587
<b>Whoever is chosen 
for the special VIP recommendation</b>

04:03.587 --> 04:07.607
<b>gets to go on to our affiliated university
without taking an exam, and all tuition is covered.</b>

04:07.607 --> 04:10.777
<b>It's our academy's dream system!</b>

04:10.777 --> 04:12.417
<b>Oh, I get it.</b>

04:12.417 --> 04:15.537
<b>Yuiga's family is dirt-poor, so...</b>

04:15.537 --> 04:17.377
<b>Hey, choose your words more carefully!</b>

04:17.377 --> 04:19.837
<b>You could say "suffering
a bit of economic hardship"!</b>

04:19.837 --> 04:24.207
<b><i>Yuiga Nariyuki from Class 3-B,
please come to the headmaster's office.</i></b>

04:24.207 --> 04:27.747
<b><i>I repeat, Yuiga Nariyuki from Class 3-B...</i></b>

