04:33.137 --> 04:36.037
<b>There's no one subject
that you especially excel at,</b>

04:36.037 --> 04:39.547
<b>but you've pretty much maintained
grades of 80% or higher in all subjects.</b>

04:39.547 --> 04:42.387
<b>In terms of behavior,
there are no complaints either.</b>

04:42.817 --> 04:44.377
<b><i>Wh-Wh-Wh-What is this?</i></b>

04:44.377 --> 04:47.097
<b><i>Why was I suddenly called in
for an interview like this?</i></b>

04:47.387 --> 04:48.657
<b>That's fine.</b>

04:48.657 --> 04:52.487
<b>I would be happy to give you
the special VIP recommendation.</b>

04:52.487 --> 04:54.277
<b>R-Really?</b>

04:54.277 --> 04:56.527
<b>However, there is one condition.</b>

04:58.487 --> 04:59.777
<b>Enter.</b>

04:59.777 --> 05:01.107
<b>Excuse me.</b>

05:02.937 --> 05:04.307
<b><i>Those two...</i></b>

05:04.827 --> 05:07.327
<b>I'm sure you know them already,</b>

05:07.327 --> 05:09.247
<b>but they're the geniuses
our school takes so much pride in.</b>

05:09.247 --> 05:11.127
<b>Furuhashi Fumino</b>

05:11.127 --> 05:12.877
<b>and Ogata Rizu.</b>

05:13.297 --> 05:15.377
<b>Yuiga Nariyuki,</b>

05:15.377 --> 05:18.547
<b>as a condition for obtaining
the special VIP recommendation,</b>

05:18.897 --> 05:21.557
<b>I order you to become their tutor</b>

05:21.557 --> 05:24.057
<b>and help them get into 
the university of their choice!</b>

