05:37.447 --> 05:39.757
<b>Of course it's the first time
a student is the tutor,</b>

05:39.757 --> 05:42.617
<b>but I'm sure you'll desert us
and hand us off to someone else</b>

05:42.617 --> 05:45.367
<b>just like all the other teachers.</b>

05:48.977 --> 05:51.837
<b><i>Why the abandoned puppy dog eyes?</i></b>

05:52.417 --> 05:54.517
<b>I won't desert you 
or hand you off to anyone else.</b>

05:54.517 --> 05:57.547
<b>After all, the special VIP
recommendation is on the line for me.</b>

05:57.837 --> 06:00.007
<b>Really? That's a relief, right, Ri?</b>

06:02.817 --> 06:04.517
<b><i>What's with them?</i></b>

06:05.077 --> 06:07.137
<b><i>Anyway, I guess we'll get started.</i></b>

06:07.137 --> 06:09.807
<b>Let me ask you what the school of your choice is.</b>

06:09.807 --> 06:12.267
<b>I haven't narrowed it down
to just one yet, but...</b>

06:12.667 --> 06:13.187
<b>Liberal arts.</b>

06:13.187 --> 06:13.937
<b>Science.</b>

06:13.937 --> 06:15.777
<b>A university known for that.</b>

06:16.827 --> 06:18.697
<b><i>That's the opposite, you dumbasses!</i></b>

06:18.997 --> 06:20.077
<b><i>Why?</i></b>

06:20.077 --> 06:22.657
<b><i>Don't they understand
the allotment of their status points?</i></b>

06:23.347 --> 06:25.277
<b><i>They're geniuses.</i></b>

06:25.277 --> 06:27.927
<b><i>Even if it's outside their field of expertise,</i></b>

06:27.927 --> 06:30.087
<b><i>they could be great at that, too!</i></b>

