<b>All right! I'll do my best!</b>

06:55.727 --> 06:57.647
<b>I don't get it at all!</b>

06:58.277 --> 07:00.417
<b>The problem itself is wrong!</b>

07:00.417 --> 07:02.247
<b>"Explain the protagonist's feelings"</b>

07:02.247 --> 07:05.237
<b>is like commanding a decoding
of the brain's entire structure,</b>

07:05.237 --> 07:07.447
<b>which even science
hasn't been able to do yet!</b>

07:08.197 --> 07:10.567
<b>No! Don't look at me!</b>

07:10.567 --> 07:15.917
<b>When I see numerical formulas,
my mind goes blank, so don't look at me!</b>

07:15.917 --> 07:20.927
<b>I know I'm lowlier than the lowliest worm!</b>

07:21.257 --> 07:23.797
<b><i>Okay, okay, Yuiga Nariyuki...</i></b>

07:23.797 --> 07:28.017
<b><i>At least now you know why you were
charged with being their tutor.</i></b>

07:28.447 --> 07:32.767
<b><i>The crux is just improving
on their weak points.</i></b>

07:32.767 --> 07:35.227
<b>We'll stop here for today.</b>

07:36.287 --> 07:37.977
<b>I'm going to give each of you an assignment,</b>

07:38.367 --> 07:39.817
<b>so get it done by tomorrow.</b>

07:40.127 --> 07:42.357
<b>I'll test you on it then!</b>

