08:09.847 --> 08:12.987
<b>Why are your scores getting worse?
I don't understand!</b>

08:12.987 --> 08:15.517
<b>You've been doing 
the same test every day for a week!</b>

08:15.597 --> 08:17.817
<b>I'm just a water flea!
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!</b>

08:17.817 --> 08:20.397
<b>Th-There's something wrong with the test.</b>

08:20.397 --> 08:22.457
<b><i>I never would've thought</i></b>

08:22.457 --> 08:25.657
<b><i>these two geniuses could be
so awful with their weak subject.</i></b>

08:25.657 --> 08:28.307
<b><i>I can see why they've been
handed off like hot potatoes.</i></b>

08:28.307 --> 08:29.287
<b><i>Oh, I know!</i></b>

08:29.587 --> 08:32.707
<b>Take out the workbooks you're using.</b>

08:34.577 --> 08:37.747
<b>You're both experts in the field
the other wants to study,</b>

08:37.747 --> 08:40.497
<b>so why don't you try
teaching each other?</b>

08:41.657 --> 08:42.757
<b>That's...</b>

08:42.757 --> 08:43.797
<b>...impossible.</b>

08:44.387 --> 08:45.047
<b>Why?</b>

08:45.047 --> 08:48.007
<b>I don't know what I don't know.</b>

08:48.267 --> 08:49.847
<b><i>A couple of geniuses!</i></b>

08:51.967 --> 08:54.107
<b>Hey, Furuhashi, Ogata...</b>

08:54.617 --> 08:57.267
<b>Instead of forcing it,
 take an entrance exam in your specialty.</b>

08:58.357 --> 08:59.757
<b>I hate to say it,</b>

08:59.757 --> 09:03.067
<b>but since it's the first semester,
what you have in mind is really tough.</b>

09:03.067 --> 09:06.617
<b>Besides, you're both incredibly 
talented in your own way.</b>

09:06.617 --> 09:08.777
<b>It would be easier 
if you used the gifts you have.</b>

09:08.777 --> 09:09.987
<b>I knew it!</b>

09:10.287 --> 09:12.617
<b>You're going to abandon us, aren't you?</b>

09:12.617 --> 09:14.867
<b>Whether I've got talent or not,</b>

09:14.867 --> 09:18.417
<b>I'm sick of people using that word
to decide what my life should be!</b>

09:20.997 --> 09:21.997
<b>Ri!</b>

09:23.767 --> 09:25.667
<b>You said you wouldn't desert us!</b>

09:25.667 --> 09:26.467
<b>What? I'm not...</b>

09:29.607 --> 09:33.307
<b>Still, I'm sure what you're saying is right.</b>

09:33.307 --> 09:38.647
<b>That's what our parents
and all the other tutors said, too.</b>

09:39.467 --> 09:42.777
<b>But even so, we...</b>

09:44.207 --> 09:45.327
<b>Thank you for this week.</b>

09:45.327 --> 09:47.357
<b>Wait, Furuhashi! Hey!</b>

09:55.917 --> 09:58.077
<b><i>What's to be done?</i></b>

09:58.077 --> 09:59.817
<b><i>No matter how you slice it,</i></b>

09:59.817 --> 10:02.957
<b><i>they'll just have to change
the school of their choice.</i></b>

10:03.397 --> 10:05.997
<b><i>For the sake of my special 
VIP recommendation, too,</i></b>

10:05.997 --> 10:09.427
<b><i>when I return their workbooks tomorrow,
I'll also try to convince them again.</i></b>

10:10.697 --> 10:14.767
<b><i>Looks like both of these 
workbooks have taken a beating.</i></b>

10:14.767 --> 10:16.887
<b><i>Did they write in them, too?</i></b>

10:23.167 --> 10:27.397
<b><i>Furuhashi and Ogata's workbooks are 
filled with notes from cover to cover.</i></b>

10:27.667 --> 10:30.657
<b><i>But the notes themselves are nonsense.</i></b>

10:30.657 --> 10:34.737
<b><i>Ogata tried answering Modern Japanese
problems with calculations.</i></b>

10:35.537 --> 10:37.497
I don't get this at all

10:35.537 --> 10:37.497
