10:35.537 --> 10:37.497

It's frustrating

10:35.537 --> 10:37.497

It's frustrating

10:37.497 --> 10:39.457
How can you understand

10:37.497 --> 10:39.457
How can you understand

10:37.497 --> 10:39.457
the main character's feelings?

10:37.497 --> 10:39.457
the main character's feelings?

10:41.897 --> 10:43.967
<b>Whether I've got talent or not,</b>

10:43.967 --> 10:47.587
<b>I'm sick of people using that word
to decide what my life should be!</b>

10:48.397 --> 10:52.047
<b>But even so, we...<i></i></b>

10:54.317 --> 10:59.057
<b><i>I wish I hadn't seen that. 
They seriously want to do this.</i></b>

11:03.957 --> 11:05.977
<b>Dad, it's frustrating!</b>

11:05.977 --> 11:09.257
<b>I tried so hard, but I still failed!</b>

11:09.257 --> 11:11.447
<b>What? Only four right?</b>

11:12.317 --> 11:14.087
<b>Nothing wrong with that.</b>

11:14.087 --> 11:15.947
<b>It shows you've got a lot of room for growth.</b>

11:16.347 --> 11:19.077
<b>You're better off than somebody
who can do it from the get-go.</b>

11:19.467 --> 11:21.077
<b>Listen, Nariyuki,</b>

11:21.077 --> 11:24.207
<b>just don't forget the frustration
you're feeling right now.</b>

11:24.547 --> 11:28.417
<b>Become a man who's able to understand
people who can't do things.</b>

11:28.707 --> 11:30.717
<b>Because only somebody
who's failed at something</b>

11:30.717 --> 11:33.797
<b>understands the feeling
of not being able to do something.</b>

11:35.297 --> 11:36.717
<b>Oh, Dad...</b>

11:38.737 --> 11:41.057
<b>You always did say the craziest things.</b>

11:41.057 --> 11:46.067
<b>Although they follow the same lessons in science and literature, 
they actually belong to different classes.</b>

11:41.057 --> 11:46.067
<b>B-But this has</b>

11:41.057 --> 11:46.067
<b>nothing to do... right?</b>

11:50.317 --> 11:51.147
<b>Sorry.</b>

11:51.447 --> 11:53.297
<b>I looked inside!</b>

11:56.377 --> 12:00.367
<b>W-Well, we left them behind,
so we're partially to blame, too.</b>

12:01.097 --> 12:04.827
<b>If there's nothing else,
we'll be on our way.</b>

12:05.197 --> 12:07.557
<b>No, wait! There's something I need to say!</b>

12:07.557 --> 12:11.007
<b>I have nothing to say to you!
And you're not going to change my mind!</b>

12:11.007 --> 12:13.467
<b>Even if I fail the exam,
it won't change what I want to study!</b>

12:13.467 --> 12:15.017
<b>No matter what?</b>

12:15.017 --> 12:18.387
<b>You may fail several years in a row
and do your best, all for naught.</b>

12:19.057 --> 12:20.677
<b>Are you trying to pick a fight?</b>

12:22.897 --> 12:25.397
<b>Yeah, no matter what.</b>

12:26.527 --> 12:27.487
<b>I see.</b>

12:28.147 --> 12:29.187
<b>I thought so.</b>

12:29.877 --> 12:33.487
<b>If you didn't feel that way, 
all of this hard work would be for naught.</b>

12:33.767 --> 12:34.867
<b>A notebook?</b>

12:34.867 --> 12:36.317
<b>What for?</b>

12:43.367 --> 12:47.137
<b>D-Don't tell me you filled 
each notebook up yourself!</b>

12:47.137 --> 12:50.347
<b>You made these advisory notes for us?</b>

12:50.347 --> 12:52.477
<b>When I looked at the workbooks
you left behind yesterday,</b>

12:52.477 --> 12:56.367
<b>I got a pretty good idea 
of where you two easily get tripped up.</b>

12:56.367 --> 12:57.487
<b>Wha...</b>

12:57.487 --> 12:59.637
<b>So you made these overnight?</b>

12:59.637 --> 13:00.717
<b>But why?</b>

13:01.047 --> 13:05.007
<b>I remembered how painful it was
to not understand something,</b>

13:05.007 --> 13:08.477
<b>knowing I wasn't good but trying to force it
which made me understand it even less.</b>

13:09.147 --> 13:12.917
<b>A long time ago, 
I was laughably bad in school.</b>

13:12.917 --> 13:15.987
<b>No matter how much I studied,
my grades didn't improve at all.</b>

13:15.987 --> 13:21.447
<b>So, I know all too well how frustrating
it is for you two, not being able to get it.</b>

13:21.797 --> 13:25.527
<b>Geniuses or not, there's no way you can be happy</b>

13:25.527 --> 13:28.107
<b>when there's something
you really want to do but can't, right?</b>

13:28.107 --> 13:29.327
<b>That's why...</b>

13:29.917 --> 13:32.827
<b>I'll make you both happy!</b>

13:32.827 --> 13:34.877
<b>Believe in me and stick with me,
for better or worse!</b>

13:40.357 --> 13:43.067
<b>Y-You're confessing your love
to both of us simultaneously?</b>

13:43.067 --> 13:44.407
<b>That's really low.</b>

13:44.407 --> 13:47.137
<b>I thought you had more integrity than that.</b>

13:47.867 --> 13:51.897
<b>N-No! I meant it like, "You're not changing
your mind, so let's do our best together!"</b>

13:51.897 --> 13:54.867
<b>I was going to suggest going
to the library now to work on the basics!</b>

13:54.867 --> 13:56.487
<b>That's what you meant?</b>

13:59.257 --> 14:01.197
<b>Um, but...</b>

14:02.177 --> 14:03.217
<b><i>Tha...</i></b>

14:03.217 --> 14:04.497
<b><i>Thank you.</i></b>

