14:09.497 --> 14:11.787
School Library

14:14.557 --> 14:18.757
<b><i>While they're studying,
I have to get my own homework done.</i></b>

14:19.457 --> 14:22.377
<b><i>After all, I'm gonna get
the special VIP recommendation.</i></b>

14:22.377 --> 14:24.057
<b><i>But fat chance of that happening 
if my grades drop</i></b>

14:24.057 --> 14:25.927
<b><i>because I'm busy with them.</i></b>

14:29.237 --> 14:30.447
<b>Furuhashi?</b>

14:31.207 --> 14:32.737
<b>Sorry, Yuiga!</b>

14:32.737 --> 14:35.277
<b>I always get sleepy 
when I look at numerical formulas!</b>

14:35.727 --> 14:36.837
<b><i>No problem.</i></b>

14:36.837 --> 14:39.347
<b><i>She smelled so good!
She smelled awesome!</i></b>

14:40.317 --> 14:41.847
<b><i>Cool your jets, Yuiga Nariyuki!</i></b>

14:41.847 --> 14:44.267
<b><i>You can't lose your head
over a pleasant scent!</i></b>

14:44.267 --> 14:44.857
<b>Yuiga...</b>

14:44.857 --> 14:45.617
<b>Yes?</b>

14:45.917 --> 14:50.147
<b>Sorry, but I don't understand
what this question means.</b>

14:50.147 --> 14:52.337
<b>Wh-Which one, Ogata?</b>

14:52.337 --> 14:54.247
<b>This second one.</b>

14:56.017 --> 14:57.907
<b>I think it means to choose
which of the following answers</b>

14:57.907 --> 15:00.427
<b>means the same thing
as the underlined part!</b>

15:00.427 --> 15:02.837
<b><i>She brushed against me!
Right up against me!</i></b>

15:03.397 --> 15:06.947
<b>H-Huh? Yuiga, you don't look well.</b>

15:06.947 --> 15:07.927
<b>Are you all right?</b>

15:07.927 --> 15:09.057
<b>R-Really?</b>

15:09.727 --> 15:10.937
<b>Maybe you have a fever.</b>

15:10.937 --> 15:12.057
<b><i>That's close! Close! Close!</i></b>

15:12.827 --> 15:14.937
<b>True, you do seem kind of off.</b>

15:15.137 --> 15:16.897
<b><i>Because you're so close to me!</i></b>

15:20.087 --> 15:25.697
<b><i>The psychological hurdle of being their tutor 
is a lot higher than I imagined!</i></b>

15:32.767 --> 15:35.127
<b>Sorry. I have to go.</b>

15:35.597 --> 15:38.507
<b>You have to help with the restaurant today, Ri?</b>

15:38.507 --> 15:39.167
<b>Restaurant?</b>

15:39.677 --> 15:42.127
<b>Ri's family has an udon restaurant.</b>

15:44.967 --> 15:46.717
<b><i>Come to think of it,</i></b>

15:46.717 --> 15:49.367
<b><i>other than the fact
that they're geniuses,</i></b>

15:49.367 --> 15:51.017
<b><i>I don't know anything about them.</i></b>

15:54.957 --> 15:57.317
<b>Even though you worked
with me until this late,</b>

15:57.617 --> 15:59.807
<b>I once again did no better
than a worm. I'm sorry!</b>

15:59.807 --> 16:02.947
<b>Well, you know, it's better
to have room for growth</b>

16:02.947 --> 16:04.807
<b>than being able to do something right away.</b>

16:04.807 --> 16:05.407
<b>Yeah.</b>

16:05.747 --> 16:08.157
<b><i>Or so my old man claimed.</i></b>

16:08.157 --> 16:11.337
<b>That's right! You know
just what to say, Yuiga!</b>

16:11.337 --> 16:12.617
<b><i>That was a quick recovery!</i></b>

16:13.077 --> 16:15.167
<b>All right! I'll do my best!</b>

16:15.167 --> 16:16.587
<b>Yeah, yeah.</b>

16:28.787 --> 16:30.847
<b>Is there something wrong, Furuhashi?</b>

16:31.327 --> 16:33.067
<b>No, sorry!</b>

16:33.067 --> 16:34.537
<b>It's nothing!</b>

16:34.537 --> 16:36.057
<b>O-Okay.</b>

16:41.607 --> 16:44.107
<b>Do you like the stars?</b>

16:45.497 --> 16:46.597
<b>Actually...</b>

16:47.697 --> 16:48.577
<b>yeah.</b>

16:50.217 --> 16:54.747
<b>I've loved the stars ever since I was little.</b>

16:54.747 --> 16:56.617
<b>On nights when the stars are beautiful,</b>

16:56.617 --> 17:00.957
<b>I find myself looking
for my late mother's star.</b>

17:06.797 --> 17:07.967
<b>Oh, sorry!</b>

17:07.967 --> 17:10.927
<b>That sounded really dumb, didn't it?</b>

17:11.667 --> 17:16.437
<b>But that was the start
of my dream, um...</b>

17:17.147 --> 17:20.357
<b>I want my life to have a connection to the stars.</b>

17:20.357 --> 17:24.457
<b>But for that, I need to pass
the science exam, right?</b>

17:25.397 --> 17:26.407
<b>So,</b>

17:26.657 --> 17:29.847
<b>I'll conquer any weakness that I have</b>

17:29.847 --> 17:32.617
<b>and seriously study astronomy!</b>

17:34.277 --> 17:37.077
<b>I hope you find your mother's star.</b>

17:39.217 --> 17:42.207
<b>It's strange, though, isn't it?
Forget it! Forget about it!</b>

17:42.207 --> 17:45.157
<b>Believing something so childish
even when I'm in high school...</b>

17:45.157 --> 17:46.497
<b>What's wrong with that?</b>

17:47.797 --> 17:51.637
<b>Actually, until just recently,
I believed something similar.</b>

17:52.087 --> 17:58.347
<b>Well, anyway, I'll help you, um,
so you can make progress with science.</b>

17:59.097 --> 18:00.467
<b>Yuiga...</b>

18:04.487 --> 18:06.647
<b>That was a promise!</b>

18:12.257 --> 18:14.087
<b><i>That was unexpected.</i></b>

18:14.087 --> 18:17.247
<b><i>I didn't realize Furuhashi was so clear
about what she wanted to do.</i></b>

18:17.907 --> 18:21.557
<b><i>Maybe Ogata has
the same kind of thing.</i></b>

18:21.557 --> 18:22.377
<b>Ogata?</b>

18:24.087 --> 18:25.207
<b>Yuiga...</b>

18:25.557 --> 18:27.647
<b>What are you doing?</b>

18:27.647 --> 18:29.677
<b>In the park this late...</b>

18:29.677 --> 18:31.977
<b>Taking a breather 
on the way back from a delivery.</b>

18:31.977 --> 18:32.927
<b>Delivery?</b>

18:32.927 --> 18:35.597
<b>Udon</b>

18:32.927 --> 18:35.597
<b>\hOgata</b>

18:33.237 --> 18:35.597
<b>Oh, that's right. The udon shop.</b>

18:36.157 --> 18:37.887
<b>So, what are you doing on your break?</b>

18:38.787 --> 18:41.807
<b>A card game for between two and ten people.</b>

18:42.357 --> 18:43.557
<b>By myself.</b>

18:43.557 --> 18:44.817
<b><i>That's too lonely!</i></b>

18:45.557 --> 18:49.167
<b>Actually, I like board games and card games,</b>

18:49.167 --> 18:51.617
<b>but I don't know many people
who are interested, so...</b>

18:51.997 --> 18:53.617
<b>I'm not familiar with that,</b>

18:53.617 --> 18:55.677
<b>but we can do a game for two.</b>

18:55.677 --> 18:57.077
<b>Tell me the rules.</b>

18:57.527 --> 19:00.537
<b>Yuiga, do you intend to beat me?</b>

19:00.827 --> 19:03.087
<b>A remark overflowing with confidence!</b>

19:03.657 --> 19:06.827
<b><i>It sounds like I'm in for a tough battle!</i></b>

19:10.377 --> 19:12.427
<b><i>I won 20 times in a row.</i></b>

19:13.297 --> 19:17.467
<b>Ogata, by any chance,
are you totally weak at this?</b>

19:19.177 --> 19:21.227
<b>Yes, very much.</b>

19:21.227 --> 19:25.397
<b>That's why I asked you before
if you intended to beat me.</b>

19:25.397 --> 19:26.687
<b>You meant it like that?</b>

19:28.937 --> 19:34.157
<b>It seems I can't draw a conclusion
with probability and calculations alone.</b>

19:34.677 --> 19:39.367
<b>I guess I'm poor at competitive games
and anything related to human emotions.</b>

19:39.997 --> 19:42.567
<b>But I want to understand
more about that.</b>

19:43.167 --> 19:47.917
<b>And that's why I want to get past
the liberal arts exam and study psychology!</b>

19:48.117 --> 19:51.627
<b><i>Oh, so there is something
that she wants to do.</i></b>

19:52.137 --> 19:58.117
<b>Well, at any rate, stop loitering
at the park by yourself at night.</b>

19:58.117 --> 20:00.807
<b>If this is your break,
I can hang out with you anytime.</b>

20:01.237 --> 20:02.057
<b>Anytime?</b>

20:02.057 --> 20:05.017
<b>Well, I meant "anytime" figuratively.</b>

20:05.017 --> 20:05.887
<b>No.</b>

20:06.867 --> 20:09.907
<b>I would be happy
if you would just once in a while.</b>

20:09.907 --> 20:11.487
<b>I'm looking forward to it!</b>

20:11.807 --> 20:15.237
<b>S-Sure. I'm looking forward to it, too.</b>

20:28.257 --> 20:29.167
<b>I'm back!</b>

20:29.627 --> 20:31.247
<b>Welcome home, brother!</b>

20:31.247 --> 20:33.927
<b>We found a lot of edible plants today!</b>

20:34.657 --> 20:36.297
<b>Good work.</b>

20:36.797 --> 20:38.097
<b>Welcome home!</b>

20:39.407 --> 20:41.307
<b>You're late today, huh?</b>

20:41.687 --> 20:44.117
<b>Dinner is almost ready.</b>

20:44.117 --> 20:46.677
<b>Brother, you smell like a woman!</b>

20:49.937 --> 20:50.777
<b>Especially...</b>

20:50.777 --> 20:51.737
<b>here!</b>

20:51.737 --> 20:53.487
<b>And here!</b>

20:54.647 --> 20:56.237
<b>What are you talking about, Mizuki?</b>

20:58.057 --> 21:00.867
<b>As always, our sister has a brother complex.</b>

21:00.867 --> 21:01.787
<b>Yep.</b>

21:09.677 --> 21:11.547
<b>Is Yuiga here?</b>

21:11.997 --> 21:14.147
<b>The Sleeping Beauty of the Literary Forest...</b>

21:14.147 --> 21:16.117
<b>and the Thumbelina Supercomputer!</b>

21:17.527 --> 21:18.797
<b>Did you want something?</b>

21:23.097 --> 21:24.197
<b>Um...</b>

21:24.197 --> 21:25.377
<b>Yuiga...</b>

21:31.247 --> 21:34.107
<b>I'm a little embarrassed
about what happened last night.</b>

21:34.777 --> 21:38.027
<b>So don't you dare tell anyone
at school about it.</b>

